    "## Preview ROIs\n",
    "\n",
    "Overlay ROI rectangles onto a video, or interactively preview a single frame.\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# Interactive preview\n",
    "interactive_preview(str(trimmed_video), rois)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Render full video with ROIs\n",
    "render_video(str(trimmed_video), rois, output_path)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "b0781babc6404f58",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-04-22T17:14:06.482184Z",
     "start_time": "2026-04-22T17:14:06.473818Z"
