   "source": [
    "## Bout Detection\n",
    "\n",
    "Detect whisking bouts by thresholding the smoothed ME signal.\n",
    "Set `BOUT_THRESHOLD` from the timeseries plot above — values above this are classified as whisking."
   ]
  },
